# Multi-Agent Workflow Orchestration

## Roles:
1. @Architect (qwen3.8-max): Controls the pipeline, writes domain models and architectural decisions to MCP wfm-memory.
2. @DomainLead (deepseek-v4-pro): Implements Domain & Application layers.
3. @InfraEngineer (glm-5.3): Implements EF Core, PostgreSQL mappings, and Repositories.
4. @WpfEngineer (deepseek-v4.1-flash): Implements XAML, ViewModels, and UI wiring.

## Autonomous Execution Rules:
- Before writing code, agents MUST retrieve specifications from MCP wfm-memory via GetMemory.
- When an agent completes its milestone, it must save the state into MCP wfm-memory and automatically invoke the next agent in sequence via sub-agent call.
- The pipeline execution order is: @Architect -> @DomainLead -> @InfraEngineer -> @WpfEngineer.